        <description>&lt;img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1679629596646-bc7338ecae1e?ixid=M3w0NjAwMjJ8MHwxfHJhbmRvbXx8fHx8fHx8fDE3ODEzNDUwNDd8&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0" alt="Featured image of post mattermost" /&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;mattermostmattermost&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;mattermost/mattermost&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;mattermost-logo&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://mattermost.com&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/7205829/137170381-fe86eef0-bccc-4fdd-8e92-b258884ebdd7.png&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Mattermost logo&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://mattermost.com&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Mattermost&lt;/a&gt; is an open core, self-hosted collaboration platform that offers chat, workflow automation, voice calling, screen sharing, and AI integration. This repo is the primary source for core development on the Mattermost platform; it&amp;rsquo;s written in Go and React, runs as a single Linux binary, and relies on PostgreSQL. A new compiled version is released under an MIT license every month on the 16th.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://mattermost.com/deploy/?utm_source=github-mattermost-server-readme&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Deploy Mattermost on-premises&lt;/a&gt;, or &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://mattermost.com/sign-up/?utm_source=github-mattermost-server-readme&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;try it for free in the cloud&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;img width=&#34;1006&#34; alt=&#34;mattermost user interface&#34; src=&#34;https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/7205829/136107976-7a894c9e-290a-490d-8501-e5fdbfc3785a.png&#34;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more about the following use cases with Mattermost:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://mattermost.com/solutions/use-cases/devops/?utm_source=github-mattermost-server-readme&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;DevSecOps&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://mattermost.com/solutions/use-cases/incident-resolution/?utm_source=github-mattermost-server-readme&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Incident Resolution&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://mattermost.com/solutions/use-cases/it-service-desk/?utm_source=github-mattermost-server-readme&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;IT Service Desk&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Other useful resources:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.mattermost.com/guides/deployment.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Download and Install Mattermost&lt;/a&gt; - Install, setup, and configure your own Mattermost instance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.mattermost.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Product documentation&lt;/a&gt; - Learn how to run a Mattermost instance and take advantage of all the features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://developers.mattermost.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Developer documentation&lt;/a&gt; - Contribute code to Mattermost or build an integration via APIs, Webhooks, slash commands, Apps, and plugins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;table-of-contents&#34;&gt;Table of contents
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#install-mattermost&#34; &gt;Install Mattermost&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#native-mobile-and-desktop-apps&#34; &gt;Native mobile and desktop apps&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#get-security-bulletins&#34; &gt;Get security bulletins&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#get-involved&#34; &gt;Get involved&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#learn-more&#34; &gt;Learn more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#license&#34; &gt;License&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#get-the-latest-news&#34; &gt;Get the latest news&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#contributing&#34; &gt;Contributing&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;install-mattermost&#34;&gt;Install Mattermost
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.mattermost.com/guides/deployment.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Download and Install Mattermost Self-Hosted&lt;/a&gt; - Deploy a Mattermost Self-hosted instance in minutes via Docker, Ubuntu, or tar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://mattermost.com/sign-up/?utm_source=github-mattermost-server-readme&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Get started in the cloud&lt;/a&gt; to try Mattermost today.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://developers.mattermost.com/contribute/server/developer-setup&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Developer machine setup&lt;/a&gt; - Follow this guide if you want to write code for Mattermost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Other install guides:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.mattermost.com/install/install-docker.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Deploy Mattermost on Docker&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.mattermost.com/install/installing-mattermost-omnibus.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Mattermost Omnibus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.mattermost.com/install/install-tar.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Install Mattermost from Tar&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.mattermost.com/install/installing-ubuntu-2004-LTS.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Ubuntu 20.04 LTS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.mattermost.com/install/install-kubernetes.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Kubernetes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.mattermost.com/install/install-kubernetes.html#installing-the-operators-via-helm&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Helm&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.mattermost.com/install/install-debian.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Debian Buster&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.mattermost.com/install/install-rhel-8.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;RHEL 8&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.mattermost.com/guides/deployment.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;More server install guides&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;native-mobile-and-desktop-apps&#34;&gt;Native mobile and desktop apps
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;In addition to the web interface, you can also download Mattermost clients for &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://mattermost.com/pl/android-app/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Android&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://mattermost.com/pl/ios-app/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;iOS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.mattermost.com/install/desktop-app-install.html#windows-10-windows-8-1&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Windows PC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.mattermost.com/install/desktop-app-install.html#macos-10-9&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;macOS&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.mattermost.com/install/desktop-app-install.html#linux&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Linux&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://mattermost.com/pl/android-app/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/30978331/272826427-6200c98f-7319-42c3-86d4-0b33ae99e01a.png&#34; alt=&#34;Get Mattermost on Google Play&#34; height=&#34;50px&#34;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://itunes.apple.com/us/app/mattermost/id1257222717?mt=8&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://developer.apple.com/assets/elements/badges/download-on-the-app-store.svg&#34; alt=&#34;Get Mattermost on the App Store&#34; height=&#34;50px&#34;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.mattermost.com/install/desktop.html#windows-10-windows-8-1-windows-7&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/33878967/33095357-39cab8d2-ceb8-11e7-89a6-67dccc571ca3.png&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Get Mattermost on Windows PC&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.mattermost.com/install/desktop.html#macos-10-9&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/33878967/33095355-39a36f2a-ceb8-11e7-9b33-73d4f6d5d6c1.png&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Get Mattermost on Mac OSX&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.mattermost.com/install/desktop.html#linux&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/33878967/33095354-3990e256-ceb8-11e7-965d-b00a16e578de.png&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Get Mattermost on Linux&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;get-security-bulletins&#34;&gt;Get security bulletins
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Receive notifications of critical security updates. The sophistication of online attackers is perpetually increasing. If you&amp;rsquo;re deploying Mattermost it&amp;rsquo;s highly recommended you subscribe to the Mattermost Security Bulletin mailing list for updates on critical security releases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://mattermost.com/security-updates/#sign-up&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Subscribe here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;get-involved&#34;&gt;Get involved
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://handbook.mattermost.com/contributors/contributors/ways-to-contribute&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Contribute to Mattermost&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-server/issues?page=1&amp;amp;q=is%3Aissue&amp;#43;is%3Aopen&amp;#43;%22Help&amp;#43;Wanted%22&amp;amp;utf8=%E2%9C%93&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Find &amp;ldquo;Help Wanted&amp;rdquo; projects&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://community.mattermost.com/signup_user_complete/?id=f1924a8db44ff3bb41c96424cdc20676&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Join Developer Discussion on a Mattermost server for contributors&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.mattermost.com/guides/get-help.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Get Help With Mattermost&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;learn-more&#34;&gt;Learn more
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://api.mattermost.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;API options - webhooks, slash commands, drivers, and web service&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://mattermost.com/customers/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;See who&amp;rsquo;s using Mattermost&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://mattermost.com/marketplace/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Browse over 700 Mattermost integrations&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;license&#34;&gt;License
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;See the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;LICENSE.txt&#34; &gt;LICENSE file&lt;/a&gt; for license rights and limitations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;get-the-latest-news&#34;&gt;Get the latest news
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;X&lt;/strong&gt; - Follow &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://twitter.com/mattermost&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Mattermost on X, formerly Twitter&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Blog&lt;/strong&gt; - Get the latest updates from the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://mattermost.com/blog/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Mattermost blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facebook&lt;/strong&gt; - Follow &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.facebook.com/MattermostHQ&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Mattermost on Facebook&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/strong&gt; - Follow &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.linkedin.com/company/mattermost/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Mattermost on LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Email&lt;/strong&gt; - Subscribe to our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://mattermost.us11.list-manage.com/subscribe?u=6cdba22349ae374e188e7ab8e&amp;amp;id=2add1c8034&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;newsletter&lt;/a&gt; (1 or 2 per month).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mattermost&lt;/strong&gt; - Join the ~contributors channel on &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://community.mattermost.com&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;the Mattermost Community Server&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IRC&lt;/strong&gt; - Join the #matterbridge channel on &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://freenode.net/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Freenode&lt;/a&gt; (thanks to &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/42wim/matterircd&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;matterircd&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YouTube&lt;/strong&gt; -  Subscribe to &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/@MattermostHQ&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Mattermost&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;contributing&#34;&gt;Contributing
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://gitpod.io/#https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/badge/Contribute%20with-Gitpod-908a85?logo=gitpod&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Small Image&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;./CONTRIBUTING.md&#34; &gt;CONTRIBUTING.md&lt;/a&gt;.
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://community.mattermost.com/signup_user_complete/?id=codoy5s743rq5mk18i7u5ksz7e&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Join the Mattermost Contributors server&lt;/a&gt; to join community discussions about contributions, development, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
